"entity": {
"name": "McGraw Hill, Inc.",
"description": "McGraw Hill, Inc. is a holding company, which engages in the provision of content and digital education solutions. It operates through the following segments: K-12, High Education, Global Professional, and International. The K-12 segment consists of blended digital and print learning solutions for end-to-end core, supplemental, and intervention curricula for K-12 schools. The High Education segment offers digital course experiences for nearly every subject through the flagship Connect solution. The Global Professional segment covers global content provision of medical and engineering learning solutions and support for learners and educational institutions. The International segment includes digital and print solutions for various countries and languages outside the United States. The company was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Columbus, OH.",
